{"id":"n70899-1-8","stage":5,"title":"유행가 · 流行歌曲","scene":"文化与休闲","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n70899-1-8-1","ko":"아빠, 방금 티브이에 나온 게 어떤 노래예요?","zh":"爸爸，刚才电视里放的那是什么歌呀？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아빠,","meaning":"爸爸","explanation":"아빠：爸爸","readings":[{"term":"아빠","audio":"/audio/c9f209994786f50d1897.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26148","senseId":"1","lemma":"아빠","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아빠","audio":"/audio/c9f209994786f50d1897.mp3"}},{"text":"방금","meaning":"刚才，方才","explanation":"방금：刚才，方才","readings":[{"term":"방금","audio":"/audio/2fd9e7d411752b4601d9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"92065","senseId":"1","lemma":"방금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"방금","audio":"/audio/2fd9e7d411752b4601d9.mp3"}},{"text":"티브이에","meaning":"电视，电视机","explanation":"티브이：电视，电视机；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"티브이","audio":"/audio/aeaf99c45109f1770ab5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71302","senseId":"1","lemma":"티브이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"티브이에","audio":"/audio/73fbead0ae5075444b72.mp3"}},{"text":"나온","meaning":"被刊登，被播放，被记载","explanation":"나오다：被刊登，被播放，被记载；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"나오다","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62233","senseId":"4","lemma":"나오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나온","audio":"/audio/a357a1f232b9a828c908.mp3"}},{"text":"게","meaning":"东西，事，的","explanation":"것：东西，事，的；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"1","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"게","audio":"/audio/c7150cec89b60925ae40.mp3"}},{"text":"어떤","meaning":"什么样的，怎么样的","explanation":"어떤：什么样的，怎么样的","readings":[{"term":"어떤","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17185","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떤","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어떤","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3"}},{"text":"노래예요?","meaning":"歌，歌曲，唱歌","explanation":"노래：歌，歌曲，唱歌；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；예요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"노래","audio":"/audio/edcad1c9c3dba9e99435.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20195","senseId":"1","lemma":"노래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"노래예요","audio":"/audio/719329ed92c83106d768.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c9f209994786f50d","term":"아빠","zh":"爸爸","audio":"/audio/c9f209994786f50d1897.mp3","entryId":"26148","definition":"在非正式场合用于指称或称呼父亲。","pronunciation":["아빠"]},{"id":"2fd9e7d411752b46","term":"방금","zh":"刚才，方才","audio":"/audio/2fd9e7d411752b4601d9.mp3","entryId":"92065","definition":"比说话时刻稍微早一点的时间。","pronunciation":["방금"]},{"id":"aeaf99c45109f177","term":"티브이","zh":"电视，电视机","audio":"/audio/aeaf99c45109f1770ab5.mp3","entryId":"71302","definition":"接收电视台以电波传送的图像与声音后使其显示出来的机器。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"038a8038eb817ffe","term":"나오다","zh":"被刊登，被播放，被记载","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3","entryId":"62233","definition":"在书籍、报纸、广播电视等上登载文章、画作或出现某种内容。","pronunciation":["나오다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"东西，事，的","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"泛指各种事物或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"a0307911a0fb4256","term":"어떤","zh":"什么样的，怎么样的","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3","entryId":"17185","definition":"用于询问人或事物的特征、内容、性格、性质、模样等。","pronunciation":["어떤"]},{"id":"edcad1c9c3dba9e9","term":"노래","zh":"歌，歌曲，唱歌","audio":"/audio/edcad1c9c3dba9e99435.mp3","entryId":"20195","definition":"给具有韵律的歌词添加曲子的音乐；或放声唱出那样的音乐。","pronunciation":["노래"]}],"audio":"/audio/0948649f57882356d13a.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n70899-1-8-2","ko":"응, 아빠가 젊었을 때 많이 부르던 유행가란다.","zh":"嗯，那是爸爸年轻时经常唱的流行歌哦。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}},{"text":"아빠가","meaning":"爸爸","explanation":"아빠：爸爸；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"아빠","audio":"/audio/c9f209994786f50d1897.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26148","senseId":"1","lemma":"아빠","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아빠가","audio":"/audio/b3bf441bc46154068ade.mp3"}},{"text":"젊었을","meaning":"年青，年轻","explanation":"젊다：年青，年轻；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；을：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"젊다","audio":"/audio/408a4bd77b296caac9e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75773","senseId":"1","lemma":"젊다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"젊었을","audio":"/audio/feecc561ef96ab549e9d.mp3"}},{"text":"때","meaning":"时，时候","explanation":"때：时，时候","readings":[{"term":"때","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74123","senseId":"1","lemma":"때","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"때","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3"}},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}},{"text":"부르던","meaning":"唱","explanation":"부르다：唱；던：修饰后面的名词，回想过去持续、反复或尚未完成的情况。","readings":[{"term":"부르다","audio":"/audio/169eb5d7a0d76e97fa7f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57304","senseId":"4","lemma":"부르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"부르던","audio":"/audio/6e21c61538bdec81fa37.mp3"}},{"text":"유행가란다.","meaning":"流行歌曲，流行歌；表示引用。","explanation":"유행가：流行歌曲，流行歌；하다：表示引用。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；라고：引用命令或名词判断；要与前后引用表达连用。；ㄴ다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"유행가","audio":"/audio/e6e50f74345c3e8788fd.mp3"},{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70899","senseId":"1","lemma":"유행가","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"22","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"유행가란다","audio":"/audio/d39ed4edf9650fe623f5.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"c9f209994786f50d","term":"아빠","zh":"爸爸","audio":"/audio/c9f209994786f50d1897.mp3","entryId":"26148","definition":"在非正式场合用于指称或称呼父亲。","pronunciation":["아빠"]},{"id":"408a4bd77b296caa","term":"젊다","zh":"年青，年轻","audio":"/audio/408a4bd77b296caac9e0.mp3","entryId":"75773","definition":"正值壮年。","pronunciation":["점ː따"]},{"id":"43bc9c47e0f938b1","term":"때","zh":"时，时候","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3","entryId":"74123","definition":"指某一瞬间或时间段。","pronunciation":["때"]},{"id":"1af2aeb1be04021c","term":"많이","zh":"多","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3","entryId":"66030","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准地。","pronunciation":["마ː니"]},{"id":"169eb5d7a0d76e97","term":"부르다","zh":"唱","audio":"/audio/169eb5d7a0d76e97fa7f.mp3","entryId":"57304","definition":"依照曲调歌唱。","pronunciation":["부르다"]},{"id":"e6e50f74345c3e87","term":"유행가","zh":"流行歌曲，流行歌","audio":"/audio/e6e50f74345c3e8788fd.mp3","entryId":"70899","definition":"在某个时期大受欢迎，很多人听唱的歌曲。","pronunciation":["유행가"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示引用。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"表示引用。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/6d68b931651e772b31e7.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.573,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=70899","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":167,"sequenceScore":3.2983,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["嗯，那是爸爸年轻时经常唱的流行歌哦。","爸爸，刚才电视里放的那是什么歌呀？","今天有谁能帮帮我吗？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["爸爸，刚才电视里放的那是什么歌呀？","今天有谁能帮帮我吗？","嗯，那是爸爸年轻时经常唱的流行歌哦。"],"answer":2}]}
